1
00:00:00,830 --> 00:00:06,460
Open your mind. Open your mind.

2
00:00:15,710 --> 00:00:22,920
Far beyond the deep blue Earth,
you and I shall meet...

3
00:00:22,920 --> 00:00:24,290
...as a gentle breeze goes by.

4
00:00:24,290 --> 00:00:29,760
AH! MY GODDESS

5
00:00:29,760 --> 00:00:36,900
A snow-white feather will come
fluttering down, swaying gently in the air.

6
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:44,010
Without holding back, I want to
envelope you, my one and only love.

7
00:00:44,010 --> 00:00:53,410
I know I have the power to protect
the one I love, right here in my hands.

8
00:00:53,410 --> 00:01:00,150
Open your mind.
Just as I've always dreamed.

9
00:01:00,150 --> 00:01:07,060
Let the wind carry off
your hopes, faraway.

10
00:01:07,060 --> 00:01:13,840
I have wings nobody can see.
Look, you have them, too.

11
00:01:13,840 --> 00:01:22,140
They'll take us to where we can be free.
Anyone can be free.

12
00:01:22,140 --> 00:01:26,640
The sky is so blue...

13
00:01:34,290 --> 00:01:39,190
..لنرى
..أحذيةٌ, ومنظفات, و

14
00:01:39,190 --> 00:01:42,000
